<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="live_view.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="live_view">
    <!-- P3 track-A: the SDL mouse-hover tile tooltip (live_view). A non-modal,
         passive overlay box anchored at the sidebar edge: a "< Mouse View >"
         title over the hovered tile's info (game::print_all_tile_info_text — the
         same producer behind the migrated look_around info pane). The box's
         left/top/width are set from C++ each sync (#lv-box) to track the sidebar
         rect; height auto-sizes to content (capped in rcss). Render-only —
         driven by the game loop's mouse handling, no input of its own. -->
    <div id="lv-box" class="lv-box">
        <div class="lv-title" data-rml="title_rml"></div>
        <div class="lv-info scroll-pane" data-rml="info_rml"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
